        "raw": "My suggestion would be to include 2 D10 Lieutenants as teammates, and have :h: = 2 total. Make one with a bonus to Boosts or Hinders, and one with a bonus to Overcomes. This way you sister can still be the star of the show, but she’s got some backup to make the game run a little smoother. Have not tried this myself, but it *seems* right.",
